<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Mølen coastal geopark route — Mølen main moraine, pebblestone and coastal loop [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>From Mølen visitor parking near Larvik, follow footpaths west through the main southern stone fields, continue on the field path and gravel track, and explore the pebblestone spur before returning by coastal paths. The loop is roughly 1.6 km; historical time and climbing estimates are approximate. Marking is partial. Choose calm, snow-free conditions, watch for loose stones and waves, and leave all stones and burial cairns untouched. Respect birds, vegetation, dog rules and closures.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. Open Database License 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/. Historical community walking-path mapping combined into this loop; not a current field survey. No elevations are assigned. Planning only; not navigation-grade.

